OL,4,BRuthless Zverev through to ATP Finals  
OL,5,Bknockout stage                         
OL,6,GWorld number one Alexander Zverev      
OL,7,Gproduced another serving masterclass   
OL,8,Gagainst Ben Shelton to qualify for the 
OL,9,GATP Finals knockout stage with a match 
OL,10,Gto spare.                              
OL,12,FThe German, 29, lost just two of the   
OL,13,F31 points played on his serve in the   
OL,14,Fsecond set as he completed an          
OL,15,Fimpressive 6-2 7-6 (7-4) win over      
OL,16,Ffourth-ranked Shelton.                 
OL,18,FThe two-time champion only made 10     
OL,19,Funforced errors and landed 25 winners  
OL,20,Fin a ruthless display to reach the     
OL,21,Fsemi-finals at the season-ending       
OL,22,Ftournament for a fifth time.           
